sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as Client
    participant F as HmacAndApiKeyAuthFilter
    participant T as TenantService (Caffeine 60 s)
    participant P as Provider (replay cache)
    participant API as Controller
    C->>C: ts = now millis<br/>sig = hex(HMAC-SHA256(secret, ts + "." + body))
    C->>F: X-API-KEY, X-Timestamp, X-Signature + body
    F->>T: resolve(apiKey)
    T-->>F: tenant + decrypted secret (AES-GCM at rest)
    alt unknown key
        F-->>C: 401 Missing or unknown X-API-KEY
    end
    F->>F: |now - ts| ≤ 5 min ?
    F->>F: constant-time compare(expected, sig)
    alt mismatch
        F-->>C: 401 payload may have been tampered with
    end
    F->>P: markProcessedIfAbsent("sig:tenant:sig", 10 min)
    alt already seen
        F-->>C: 401 Replayed request rejected
    end
    F->>API: authenticated TenantPrincipal + cached body
    API-->>C: 2xx
